---

The MIT terms above cover this repository's own work: the image recipe
(config/, runtime/, scripts/, tools/, profiles/), the documentation under
docs/ and archive/, and the workspace checks.

They do NOT relicense third-party material:

  * patches/freebsd/*.patch and archive/rv2-fork-lane/patches/*.patch modify
    FreeBSD sources and carry the license of the files they touch: the kernel
    and driver files are BSD-2-Clause (sys/dev/smte/if_smte* also carry ISC
    portions from OpenBSD), and the device-tree files under
    sys/contrib/device-tree are GPL-2.0 OR MIT per their SPDX headers.
  * archive/wifi-ap6256/brcmfmac/ is an ISC-licensed driver port; see its
    LICENSE.
  * archive/wifi-ap6256/firmware/ contains redistributable proprietary
    Broadcom firmware under LICENSE.brcm80211 in that directory.
  * The freebsd-src and OPNsense-RISC repositories (sibling checkouts
    pinned by config/, not part of this tree) each carry their own
    LICENSE/COPYRIGHT.

Images produced by this repository are aggregations of FreeBSD and the
material above; the corresponding notices travel with them.
